# wiegand, from test/pin_trace.ml: do not edit
# cycles ui_in uio_in uo_out uio_out uio_oe; cycle 0 is the first rising edge
# after rst_n rises, outputs are the values after the edge
# sigrok clock 48000000
# sigrok decoder wiegand:d0=OUT0:d1=OUT1:bitwidth_ms=1
# sigrok annotations wiegand=state
# sigrok expect wiegand-1: 26 bits 00010101000010010001101001
# sigrok joins_after 100
# sigrok misread why both lines are low from reset until the firmware starts, which the decoder reads as invalid
# sigrok misread at 0
# sigrok misread reads wiegand-1: invalid
# sigrok tooth flip:OUT0:1:0:2400
# sigrok tooth flip:OUT1:1:800:800
